Hello,

My use case for mlmmj is team alias

In classic setup had  a team an entry in /etc/alias
with forwarding to the team members.
That worked for years, but start breaking with the rise of SPF.

With mlmmj there is a mailinglist for each team,
that works in the age of SPF, Sending Policy Framework.


This "my use case" email is for explaining/announcing further work
on mlmmj by me.


